id: zbt2_reset_button_zigbee_token
label: ZBT-2 Reset Button (Zigbee Token Reset)
package: custom
description: >-
  Switches the ZBT-2 reset button's factory-reset backend to sl_zigbee_token_factory_reset,
  which preserves frame counters and the boot counter (routers), instead of the default full
  NVM3 erase. Add this alongside zbt2_reset_button on zigbee routers only — it pulls zigbee
  FFI that the OpenThread RCP build can't link.
category: Platform|Driver|Button
quality: production
provides:
  - name: zbt2_reset_button_zigbee_token
requires:
  - name: zbt2_reset_button
template_contribution:
  # Enables the ohf-zbt2-reset-button crate's `zigbee_token_reset` cargo feature.
  - name: ohf_rust_feature
    value: zbt2_reset_button_zigbee_token
